:0.42608695652173917,\"_genreOverlap\":1},{\"id\":214463,\"title\":\"The Real Housewives of Amsterdam\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/nFZR1hkZv9xMBvJr3deBk6lejmj.jpg\",\"rating\":4.8,\"year\":2022,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.42586206896551726,\"_genreOverlap\":1},{\"id\":61868,\"title\":\"The Real Housewives of Cheshire\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/2yHVYahwgA0bkSkKZAbWgd3M9Mm.jpg\",\"rating\":5,\"year\":2015,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.42424242424242425,\"_genreOverlap\":1},{\"id\":313137,\"title\":\"The Golden Life\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/e7OGE2mfvhfDCd1jJNju5G155hX.jpg\",\"rating\":8,\"year\":2026,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.42142857142857143,\"_genreOverlap\":1},{\"id\":35365,\"title\":\"The Real Housewives of Athens\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/9iojjMtKBYVGXEf7Sz1YnBFePNO.jpg\",\"rating\":3,\"year\":2011,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.4197368421052632,\"_genreOverlap\":1}],\"seasonNumber\":1,\"seasonName\":\"Season 1\",\"seasonOverview\":\"In the hyper-competitive world of Manhattan high society, supreme social connector Jill Zarin fiercely protects her inner circle while navigating the elite charity circuit alongside her closest confidante, witty culinary entrepreneur Bethenny Frankel. Operating on a completely different plane is Luann de Lesseps, whose rigid demands for etiquette as a European Countess clash with ambitious Brooklyn outliers Alex McCord and her husband Simon’s desperate attempts to climb the social ladder. Bustling through it all is filterless fashion buyer Ramona Singer, whose blunt critiques and erratic energy constantly disrupt the polite veneer of their gatherings and ignite intense tension with Alex.\",\"seasonPoster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/bMO8sdZo7QKpwvXCRBqrL9Zs3Yh.jpg\",\"seasonAirDate\":\"2008-03-04\",\"episodes\":[{\"number\":1,\"name\":\"Meet the Wives\",\"overview\":\"Ramona heads to the Hamptons for the summer, only to embarrass her daughter at a pool party. In other events, LuAnn also gears up for the Hamptons; Bethenny focuses on her career and her relationship with her boyfriend; and Alex vacations in St. Barts.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/wuRCwsHig8gqn5dCGF9ICvp1MXS.jpg\",\"rating\":6.5,\"voteCount\":2,\"airDate\":\"2008-03-04\",\"runtime\":60},{\"number\":2,\"name\":\"The Hamptons\",\"overview\":\"As Jill and Allyson journey to a plush health center on Martha's Vineyard, Ramona gears up for a Hamptons-based fashion show and LuAnn's daughter participates in an elite equestrian competition. Meanwhile, Ramona serves up a cooking party, but things turn testy when one housewife isn't invited.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/bWxiQEVBMWemzfrIShMZObIMZU9.jpg\",\"rating\":7,\"voteCount\":2,\"airDate\":\"2008-03-11\",\"runtime\":60},{\"number\":3,\"name\":\"Fashion Week\",\"overview\":\"Shopping and fashion come to the fore when Jill squires her daughter on an expensive shopping trip, and Bethenny later hits the stores with Jill. Meanwhile, Ramona attends a Fashion Week show, but catty problems arise when she scores a choice seat at the event; and Ramona's daughter struts her stuff at an elite modeling agency.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/xoaOikVZ9rt611IFO8wyeUjurmF.jpg\",\"rating\":7,\"voteCount\":2,\"airDate\":\"2008-03-18\",\"runtime\":60},{\"number\":4,\"name\":\"Social Wife\",\"overview\":\"Four of the housewives gather for dinner at a ritzy restaurant, but not all goes down easy when Alex annoys Bethenny. Other wives' tales: Ramona hits the town with her gal pals; LuAnn socializes with her twentysomething niece; Bethenny tries to take her romance to the next level; and Ramona escorts her daughter to a film audition.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/mGYS1YwwqNmbWJ788efeL2cOyRI.jpg\",\"rating\":7,\"voteCount\":2,\"airDate\":\"2008-03-25\",\"runtime\":60},{\"number\":5,\"name\":\"Careful, She Bites\",\"overview\":\"Bethenny serves up healthy culinary pointers to Alex, but events turn sour when romantic problems are disclosed. Elsewhere, Alex basks in a birthday bash on a yacht; and Ramona's daughter preps for a school dance.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/1T3VJKAE2MQjkEXZ6UyhacA30Kc.jpg\",\"rating\":7,\"voteCount\":2,\"airDate\":\"2008-04-01\",\"runtime\":60},{\"number\":6,\"name\":\"Girls' Night Out\",\"overview\":\"LuAnn's son objects to her busy social schedule when she and Bethenny go to dinner after having drinks at the house. Elsewhere, an aloof Jason is late to a dinner with Bethenny, Jill and Bobby; and Alex brings Simon to a girls-only night, a move that irks Ramona.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/69Uf6uOwXn2ZWLgyN0e5r5ydIu3.jpg\",\"rating\":7.5,\"voteCount\":2,\"airDate\":\"2008-04-08\",\"runtime\":60},{\"number\":7,\"name\":\"Second Chances\",\"overview\":\"In the Season 1 finale, the de Lesseps family visits the Statue of Liberty. Meanwhile, Bobby showers Jill with various gifts---but he fails to win points with an offering of lingerie. And Jill throws a holiday bash for the housewives.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/ikExTFFhaYrkJg2lOd4B3vVxuGn.jpg\",\"rating\":7,\"voteCount\":2,\"airDate\":\"2008-04-15\",\"runtime\":60},{\"number\":8,\"name\":\"Reunion: Watch What Happens\",\"overview\":\"Andy Cohen hosts a reunion edition, featuring the New York cast recapping Season 1 highlights and lowlights. Addressed: the dynamic between Jill and Ramona; and Bethenny's romantic dramas.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/p7LAfMdx0nplJleHrcFR9tnJKqW.jpg\",\"rating\":7.5,\"voteCount\":2,\"airDate\":\"2008-04-22\",\"runtime\":60},{\"number\":9,\"name\":\"The Lost Footage\",\"overview\":\"Previously unseen footage from the sudsy, New York-based reality show is presented. Included: insight into Bethenny's romantic life; drama at a Hamptons party; extended snippets of a catfight; and sparked rumors.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/fx9N8crM4D2jDc6FK2PmSitj4lr.jpg\",\"rating\":6.5,\"voteCount\":2,\"airDate\":\"2008-05-27\",\"runtime\":60}],\"firstAirDate\":\"2008-03-04\"}","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":86400,"tags":[]}